OL,3,CMore than #2,000 raised by
OL,4,Cfirefighters in memory of father and
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FA team of Jersey firefighters and
OL,8,Ftheir children will scale the UK's
OL,9,Fhighest peak in tribute to a local
OL,10,Ffather and son.
OL,12,FThe 'Dads, Lads and Lasses Scottish
OL,13,FAdventure' will aim to climb Ben Nevis
OL,14,Fon Friday 14 August, with half of the
OL,15,Fmoney they raise money for The Lowe's
OL,16,FLegacy Fund.
OL,18,FThe Fund was set up in memory of Dean
OL,19,Fand Charlie Lowe, who died after a hit-
OL,20,Fand-run collision in the summer of
OL,21,F2023.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
