OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786468726
OL,3,CMore than #2,000 raised by
OL,4,Cfirefighters in memory of father and
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FThe charity promotes accessibility to
OL,8,Fthe arts and music by supporting
OL,9,Fdisadvantaged communities on the
OL,10,FIsland and aiding the development of
OL,11,Findividuals with learning disabilities.
OL,13,FThe other half of the funds raised
OL,14,Fwill also go to The Firefighters
OL,15,FCharity, which supports firefighters
OL,16,Fin the Channel Islands and across the
OL,17,FUK.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
