CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786468726
OL,3,CMore than #2,000 raised by
OL,4,Cfirefighters in memory of father and
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FFour firefighters and their children -
OL,8,Faged between seven and 14 - will take
OL,9,Fon the challenge, which includes some
OL,10,Fof Charlie's classmates.
OL,12,FFirefighter Richard Wilson's twin
OL,13,Fsons, Charlie and Archie, came up with
OL,14,Fthe fundraising idea after
OL,15,Fbrainstorming on how to complete their
OL,16,FDuke of Edinburgh challenge as Sea
OL,17,FCadets.
OL,19,F"My children were in Charlie's class
OL,20,Fall the way from nursery," Richard
OL,21,Ftold ITV News.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
