PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786468726
OL,3,CMore than #2,000 raised by
OL,4,Cfirefighters in memory of father and
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,F"They came to me about six or seven
OL,8,Fmonths ago and said they'd like to
OL,9,Fmark their memory in some way.
OL,11,F"It was sort of decided they might
OL,12,Fwant to do a challenge of some
OL,13,Fdescription, so we put our heads
OL,14,Ftogether and thought about Ben Nevis."
OL,16,FRichard said while the challenge will
OL,17,Fbe difficult, he looks forward to
OL,18,Fspending time with his sons. He said
OL,19,Fafter discussing the challenge with
OL,20,Fhis colleagues, others were keen to
OL,21,Fcome on board.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
