CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786468726
OL,3,CMore than #2,000 raised by
OL,4,Cfirefighters in memory of father and
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,F"I think we see that time and time
OL,8,Fagain, with the Jersey community, they
OL,9,Fcome together," Richard said.
OL,11,F"The children were really affected,
OL,12,Fand we didn't need to persuade anybody
OL,13,Fto get involved; it was quite easy, so
OL,14,Fit says a lot about the community we
OL,15,Flive in."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/5
